Legend

DAP          : Days after planting
Stage        : 0: before/after planting
Stage        : 1: emergence or transplant recovery
Stage        : 2: vegetative stage
Stage        : 3: flowering
Stage        : 4: yield formation and ripening
CCsim        : simulated Green Canopy Cover
CCobs        : observed Green Canopy Cover (-9.0 = no field data)
CCstd        : standard deviation of observed Green Canopy Cover
Bsim         : simulated Cumulative biomass
Bobs         : observed Cumulative biomass  (-9.000 = no field data)
Bstd         : standard deviation of observed Cumulative biomass
SWCsim       : simulated Soil Water Content for specified soil depth
SWCobs       : observed Soil Water Content for specified soil depth (-9.0 = no field data)
SWCstd       : standard deviation of observed Soil Water Content for specified soil depth
